{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":40,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["頌讚之歌"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的詩，交與伶長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我曾耐性等候耶和華；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他垂聽我的呼求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他從禍坑裏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從淤泥中，把我拉上來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的腳立在磐石上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我腳步穩當。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使我口唱新歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是讚美我們上帝的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"許多人必看見而懼怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要倚靠耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"那倚靠耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不理會狂傲和偏向虛假之輩的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這人便為有福！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華－我的上帝啊，你所行的奇事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並你向我們所懷的意念甚多，不能向你陳明；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若要陳明，其事不可勝數。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"祭物和禮物，你不喜悅；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你已經開通我的耳朵。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燔祭和贖罪祭非你所要。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時我說：看哪，我來了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的事在經卷上已經記載了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝啊，我樂意照你的旨意行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的律法在我心裏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我在大會中宣傳公義的佳音；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不止住我的嘴唇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，這是你所知道的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我未曾把你的公義藏在心裏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已陳明你的信實和你的救恩；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在大會中未曾隱瞞你的慈愛和誠實。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，求你不要向我止住你的慈悲！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你的慈愛和誠實常常保佑我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["求助的禱告"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"因有無數的禍患圍困我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的罪孽追上了我，使我不能昂首；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這罪孽比我的頭髮還多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就心寒膽戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你開恩搭救我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，求你速速幫助我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那些尋找我、要滅我命的，一同抱愧蒙羞！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那些喜悅我受害的，退後受辱！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那些對我說阿哈、阿哈的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因羞愧而敗亡！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"願一切尋求你的，因你高興歡喜！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願那些喜愛你救恩的，常說：當尊耶和華為大！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我是困苦窮乏的，主仍顧念我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是幫助我的，搭救我的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝啊，求你不要耽延！","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/40.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/41.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/39.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}